<html>
  <head>
    <title>JobCard</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: 'Inter'; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-size: 12px; /*
      Default font size */ } .header { text-align: right; padding: 0px 20px;
      margin-bottom: -10px; } .header img { max-width: 150px; } .line {
      border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin: 10px 0; } .branch-details,
      .customer-details, .booking-details { padding: 0 20px; } .center-text {
      text-align: center; font-size: 18px; /* Reduced size for the centered
      "ESTIMATE" text */ font-weight: bold; margin: 5px 0; color: darkred; }
      .details-container { display: flex; justify-content: space-between;
      margin: 20px 0; } .details-box { width: 48%; padding: 10px; } .details-box
      p { margin: 0; padding: 3px 0; /* Reduced padding */ font-size: 12px; /*
      Reduced font size for key-value pairs */ } .details-box .key {
      font-weight: bold; } .details-table, .items-table { width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse; margin: 10px 0; } .details-table-new,
      .items-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 10px 0; }
      .details-table-new th, .details-table-new td, .items-table th,
      .items-table td { border: 1px solid #ffffff; padding: 0px; /* Reduced
      padding */ text-align: left; font-size: 10px; /* Reduced font size for
      table content */ } .details-table td, .items-table th, .items-table td {
      border: 2px solid #000; padding: 5px; /* Reduced padding */ text-align:
      left; font-size: 10px; /* Reduced font size for table content */ }
      .details-table th { border: 2px solid #000; padding: 5px; text-align:
      center; font-size: 10px; } .footer { padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 12px;
      /* Reduced font size for footer content */ } .footer .signatures {
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; } .bold { font-weight:
      bold; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div style='display: flex; justify-content:space-between'>
      <div style='display:flex;'>
        <table class='details-table-new' style='margin-left: 10px;'>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
                            <td>{{outlet.outletName}}</td>

            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>{{outlet.address}},</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>{{outlet.city}},{{outlet.state}},{{outlet.pincode}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Mobile: {{outlet.mobile}},</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <div class='header'>
        <img
          src='data:image/png;base64,{{base64Logo}}'
          alt='Logo'
          style='height: 30px; width:100px'
        />
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class='line'></div>
    <table class='details-table-new'>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th style='display: flex; justify-content:space-between;'><div
            >PAN</div><div>:</div></th>
          <td></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th style='display: flex; justify-content:space-between;'><div
            >GSTIN</div><div>:</div></th>
          <td>{{outlet.dealerGstin}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr><th colspan='4'><div class='line'></div></th></tr>
        <tr>
          <th colspan='4' style='text-align: center;'><div class='center-text'>JOB CARD</div></th>
        </tr>
        <tr><th colspan='4'><div class='line'></div></th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr style='vertical-align: top;'>
          <th style='display: flex; justify-content:space-between'><div
            >Customer</div><div>:</div></th>
          <td>
            {{customer.name}}
            <br />
            {{customer.address}}
            <br />
            {{customer.city}},
            {{customer.state}}
            <br />
            {{customer.pincode}}
            <br />
            {{customer.mobile}}
          </td>
          <th style='display: flex; justify-content:space-between'><div>Job card
              number</div><div>:</div></th>
          <td>{{customer.documentName}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th style='display: flex; justify-content:space-between'><div>Customer
              GSTIN</div><div>:</div></th>
          <td>{{customer.gstin}}</td>
          <th style='display: flex; justify-content:space-between'><div
            >Date</div><div>:</div></th>
          <td>{{customer.documentDate}}</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <table class='details-table'>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th colspan='2'>VEH/ENG DETAILS</th>
          <th colspan='2'>JOBCARD DETAILS</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Vehicle</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{customer.model}}</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Checkin time</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{customer.checkinTime}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Registration No</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{customer.regNo}}</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Attended time</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{customer.repairType}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Chassis No</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{customer.chassisNo}}</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Document Created</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{customer.serviceType}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Engine No</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{customer.engNo}}</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Expected Completion</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{customer.expectedTime}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>KM reading</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{customer.kmReading}}</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Spare amount</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{partAmtRound}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Repair type</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{customer.repairType}}</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Labour Amount</td>
          {{#if customer.isAJC}}
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{totalRoundLabAmountAJC}}</td>
          {{else}}
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{labAmtRound}}</td>
          {{/if}}
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Service Type</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{customer.serviceType}}</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Total cost</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{totalLaborPartsAmountRnd}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Service Engineer</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{customer.createdBy}}</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'></td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'></td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <table class='details-table'>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th style='width: 50%; text-align: center;'>CUSTOMER VOICE</th>
          <th style='width: 50%; text-align: center;'>SERVICE ENGINEER REMARKS</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td style='width: 50%;'>{{customer.customerVoice}}</td>
          <td style='width: 50%;'>{{customer.serviceEngineerRemarks}}</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <table class='details-table'>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th style='text-align: center; width:10%'>SNO</th>
          <th style='text-align: center; width:20%'>CODE</th>
          <th style='text-align: center; width:50%'>DESCRIPTION</th>
          <th style='text-align: center; width:20%'>QUANTITY</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {{#if labours.length}}
        <tr>
          <td colspan='4'>Labour</td>
        </tr>
        {{#each labours}}
          <tr>
            <td>{{this.sno}}</td>
            <td>{{this.rot_code}}</td>
            <td>{{this.description}}</td>
            <td>{{this.quantity}}</td>
          </tr>
        {{/each}}
        {{/if}}
        {{#if parts.length}}
        <tr>
          <td colspan='4'>Parts</td>
        </tr>
        {{#each parts}}
          <tr>
            <td>{{this.sno}}</td>
            <td>{{this.code}}</td>
            <td>{{this.description}}</td>
            <td>{{this.quantity}}</td>
          </tr>
        {{/each}}
        {{/if}}
        {{#if partIndents.length}}
        <tr>
          <td colspan='4'>Parts Indents</td>
        </tr>
        {{#each partIndents}}
          <tr>
            <td>{{this.sno}}</td>
            <td>{{this.code}}</td>
            <td>{{this.description}}</td>
            <td>{{this.quantity}}</td>
          </tr>
        {{/each}}
        {{/if}}

      </tbody>
    </table>
    <table class='details-table'>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th colspan='2'>LAST JOB CARD DETAILS</th>
          <th colspan='2'>AMOUNT DETAILS</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Job Card No</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{prevData.cardNo}}</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Spare Amount</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{prevTotal.partsAmt}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Job Card Date</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{prevData.cardDate}}</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Labour Amount</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{prevTotal.labourAmt}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Repair Type</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{prevData.repairType}}</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Total Amount</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{prevTotal.grandAmt}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Service Type</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{prevData.serviceType}}</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>KM Reading</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>{{prevData.kmReading}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style='width: 25%;'>Mechanic Name</td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'></td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'></td>
          <td style='width: 25%;'></td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p>
      I am leaving the vehicle detailed in this Repair Order for repairs and for
      attending to such jobs that are listed in the Repair Order Sheet and in
      the Continuation Repair Order Sheets.You may also carryout such other jobs
      as you find it necessary during the course of repairs and after
      dismantaling to make the vehicle roadworthy.
    </p>
    <p>
      I hereby agree and definitely understand that Messrs.TEST MFCL. assume no
      responsibility for loss or damage by whatsoever means to vehicle placed
      with them for storage,sale or repair.The above vehicle left in your
      premises is entirely at my/my employers/owners risk as accidents,damage by
      fire or any other cause. I also authorize you to carry out the road
      test/test drive in my vehicle at my/my employers/owners risk/cost.
    </p>
    <p>
      All disputes arising out of or in connection with this bill/invoice shall
      be subject to exclusive jurisdiction of the Courts in Chennai alone.
    </p>
    <table class='details-table-new'>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th
            style='padding-left:0px; padding-top:10px;'
          >______________________</th>
          <th
            style='text-align: right; padding-top:10px;'
          >______________________</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th style='padding-left:0px; padding-top:10px;'>Customer Signature</th>
          <th style='text-align: right; padding-top:10px;'>Authorized Signature</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>